          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On May 16, 2008, around 11 PM, a witness observed a glowing ball moving from left to right behind the clouds. This testimony is very unremarkable and the description too vague for serious study. The witness did not respond to our request for a questionnaire and to provide a statement to the gendarmerie. The limited information provided allows for the possibility of multiple entirely known phenomena. Without precise data, the GEIPAN classifies this case as \"C\" due to lack of information.",
